          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isitha sathi: Ngiyakubaxosha, ngifice, ngahlukanise impango; ukunxanela kwami kuyakwaneliswa phezu kwabo; ngiyakuhosha inkemba yami, isandla sami sibachithe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.9",
