              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakubangenisa, ubatshale entabeni yelifa lakho, endaweni oyenzele ukuthi uhlale kuyo, Nkosi, endaweni engcwele, Nkosi, ezayimisayo izandla zakho.",
          "type": "text",
