              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMiriyamu umprofethikazi, udadewabo ka-Aroni, waphatha isigubhu ngesandla sakhe; bonke abesifazane baphuma bamlandela bephethe izigubhu nokusina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
