              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMiriyamu wawaphendula wathi: Hlabelelani inkazimulo yeNkosi, ngoba iphakeme kakhulu; ihhashi nomgibeli walo wakuphonsa olwandle.",
          "type": "text",
