          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wayesebahola abakwa-Israyeli besuka eLwandle Olubomvu, baphuma baya ehlane laseSuri; bahamba insuku ezintathu enkangala, kabatholanga manzi.",
          "type": "text",
