              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “Uma ulalela nokulalela izwi likaJehova uNkulunkulu wakho, wenze okulungile emehlweni akhe, ulalele imiyalo yakhe, ugcine zonke izimiso zakhe, angiyikubeka nasinye salezi zifo. Engakwehlisela phezu kwabaseGibithe, ngokuba nginguJehova ophilisayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
